# Default validation messages, as RDF.
#
# What this file is: the wording shown for a constraint violation when the shape's
# author wrote no `sh:message` in the reader's language. One resource per SHACL
# constraint component, one `sh:message` literal per language. It is data, not code:
# a language is added by supplying more triples (`useMetadataForm({ messages })`),
# never by editing the library.
#
# Why `sh:message` on the component. SHACL defines `sh:message` as the wording of
# the results a constraint produces (SHACL §2.1.5: the values are copied into the
# results' `sh:resultMessage`), and lets SHACL-SPARQL constraints and
# component validators declare one too (§5.1, §6.2.2).
# A constraint component's message is that same statement one level up: "results
# this component produces read like this, unless the shape says otherwise". No term
# is minted in a W3C namespace. The alternatives said something else: `rdfs:comment`
# and `skos:definition` describe the COMPONENT, not the error a reader sees.
# The W3C `shacl.ttl` cannot serve as this data: it carries `@en` only and describes
# components. Reading `sh:message` on a component is our convention, not a SHACL rule.
#
# `sh:ConstraintComponent` itself (the class of all components) holds the message
# for any component this file does not name.
#
# Language: Catalan.

@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

sh:MinCountConstraintComponent sh:message "Aquest camp és obligatori"@ca .
sh:MaxCountConstraintComponent sh:message "Massa valors"@ca .
sh:DatatypeConstraintComponent sh:message "Tipus de valor no vàlid"@ca .
sh:NodeKindConstraintComponent sh:message "Classe de valor no vàlida"@ca .
sh:PatternConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no coincideix amb el patró requerit"@ca .
sh:MinLengthConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor és massa curt"@ca .
sh:MaxLengthConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor és massa llarg"@ca .
sh:ClassConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no és del tipus esperat"@ca .
sh:InConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no és una opció permesa"@ca .
sh:NodeConstraintComponent sh:message "Falten dades en aquesta secció"@ca .
sh:PropertyConstraintComponent sh:message "Hi ha dades no vàlides en aquesta propietat"@ca .
sh:QualifiedValueShapeConstraintComponent sh:message "Alguns valors no són els esperats aquí"@ca .
sh:QualifiedMinCountConstraintComponent sh:message "No hi ha prou valors que compleixin allò esperat"@ca .
sh:QualifiedMaxCountConstraintComponent sh:message "Hi ha massa valors que compleixen allò esperat"@ca .
sh:ReifierShapeConstraintComponent sh:message "Falten dades sobre aquesta declaració"@ca .
sh:AndConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no compleix tots els requisits"@ca .
sh:OrConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no compleix cap de les alternatives permeses"@ca .
sh:XoneConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor ha de complir exactament una de les alternatives"@ca .
sh:NotConstraintComponent sh:message "Aquest valor no està permès aquí"@ca .
sh:IfConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no compleix el requisit que s'aplica aquí"@ca .
sh:MinInclusiveConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor és massa petit"@ca .
sh:MinExclusiveConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor és massa petit"@ca .
sh:MaxInclusiveConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor és massa gran"@ca .
sh:MaxExclusiveConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor és massa gran"@ca .
sh:LanguageInConstraintComponent sh:message "Aquest idioma no està permès"@ca .
sh:UniqueLangConstraintComponent sh:message "Només es permet un valor per idioma"@ca .
sh:EqualsConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor ha de coincidir amb el del camp relacionat"@ca .
sh:DisjointConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor ha de ser diferent del camp relacionat"@ca .
sh:LessThanConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor ha de ser menor que el del camp relacionat"@ca .
sh:LessThanOrEqualsConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor ha de ser menor o igual que el del camp relacionat"@ca .
sh:HasValueConstraintComponent sh:message "Falta un valor obligatori"@ca .
sh:ClosedConstraintComponent sh:message "Aquesta propietat no està permesa aquí"@ca .
sh:SPARQLConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no compleix un requisit personalitzat"@ca .
sh:ConstraintComponent sh:message "Valor no vàlid"@ca .
